"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2717,"Narrated to us by Abu Salamah Yahya bin Al-Mughirah, who said: Abu 'Asim narrated to us from Ja'far bin Muhammad, from his father, from Jabir (RA), who said: ""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) performed Ramal (walking briskly with chest out) for three circuits and walked normally for four circuits."""
